{
  "id": "7665879384142",
  "title": "High Shine Conditioning Hair Colour - Chocolate Dark Brown (Shade 3)",
  "description": "Hair colour that wrecks your strands? Sorry, not sorry, it’s out of the dye-logue. So, if you’ve ever hesitated before hitting a YES on that colour change, this one’s for you. BBLunt Salon Secret High Shine Conditioning Hair Colour – in Chocolate Dark Brown, now upgraded with smarter science, more intense payoff, and a bold new design. It shuts down the damage drama with a game-changing formula that lets you go bold without holding back. Co-created by salon experts for Indian hair, it delivers 100% grey coverage* with rich, lasting pigment. This salon-grade hair colour is powered by MalipPeptide BondTech™ that’s packed in the Bond Repair Serum Concentrate. It’s a breakthrough technology that strengthens hair bonds from within, minimising breakage as you colour. And that’s not all! Each box comes with a Shine Tonic Hair Mask that locks in moisture and adds a high-shine finish that looks and feels like you just stepped out of the salon. No ammonia. No fading fast. No compromising on strength. Just a rich, vibrant colour that lasts up to 32 washes!* Because with BBlunt, when you Colour Outside, you Care Inside. Disclaimer: Depends on the natural colour of the hair & extent of greys.",
